# Normalise to LF in the repo and on checkout, on every platform.
#
# This is not cosmetic: scripts/deploy-android-debug.sh runs under bash on the
# NDK path, and a CRLF checkout breaks its shebang in a way that reads as a
# missing interpreter. Windows autocrlf would otherwise do exactly that.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bin binary
*.exe binary
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
